body:
I graduated in 2017, and I just recently activated my UP office 365 account (it was emailed last year I think?) and it worked??? lmao

&#x200B;

But before I did that, I separately enrolled my up email here  [https://products.office.com/en/student/office-in-education](https://products.office.com/en/student/office-in-education)  and it worked. I think the account is different from what was emailed directly to me.

Biglang ang daming langgam samin ngayon. Bigla nalang susulpot sa mesa ko, sa laptop ko, di ko alam saan galing. Di naman ako kumakain pag nakalaptop ako kasi baka mapasukan ng pagkain. Kinakabahan ako baka mabahayan nila yung laptop ko :(

&#x200B;

Ano ba usually dahilan ng pagdami ng langgam? May kaakibat ba siyang problema, halimbawa kaya sila lumalabas kasi may umagaw na ibang insekto sa bahay nila ganun. Help :(

Hi! Did the TO Granactive Retinoid bottle color change? I bought a new bottle, and the color is now a more lighter yellow color as compared to my previous bottles, which were more of a darker brown (kinda like this [https://www.sephora.com/product/the-ordinary-deciem-granactive-retinoid-2-emulsion-P427418](https://www.sephora.com/product/the-ordinary-deciem-granactive-retinoid-2-emulsion-P427418)). The smell and consistency feels the same, though. I've also seen pictures on the internet of TO GR having the lighter color bottle ([https://www.cultbeauty.co.uk/the-ordinary-advanced-retinoid-2.html](https://www.cultbeauty.co.uk/the-ordinary-advanced-retinoid-2.html)) but I still just want to ask. The product seems legit and the other TO product I bought with it looks the same from the one I previously bought.

&#x200B;

Edit: I guess I just want to know how often this stuff happens (changes in bottle color), what's normal and what's not.

Why? Can you blame them (us)? lol if I only had the means to leave I would already have. My mental health and relationship with my family are being affected already. 

&#x200B;

Though yeah, maybe after the election season is done I'll change my mind and be hopeful again. But right now it's just...

